OL,3,GNEWSATeen racing driver makes history
OL,4,Ain car built with dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage racing driver who helped
OL,7,Fbuild his own championship-winning car
OL,8,Fwith his father has broken records in
OL,9,Fjunior motorsport.
OL,11,FDara McInerney, who is from Mow Cop in
OL,12,FStaffordshire, has spent the past two
OL,13,Fseasons competing in the BRSCC Fiesta
OL,14,FJunior Championship.
OL,16,FThis year, he finished on the podium in
OL,17,F17 of his 18 races, winning 14 of them
OL,18,F- the most victories recorded in a
OL,19,Fsingle season, according to organisers.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
